#, php-format
msgid "Your %2$s plan does not include the model \"%1$s\". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them."
msgstr "Uw %2$s-abonnement bevat het model \"%1$s\" niet. Kies een ander model in de AI-instellingen of upgrade uw abonnement via hen."

